{"id":"vod_md_6186","vodId":"6186","provider":"md","providerName":"魔都动漫","type":2,"name":"虫师 续章","name_cn":"虫师 续章","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"20集全","images":{"common":"https://www.mdzypic.com/upload/vod/20231023-1/fbedb9022d80f5738a59846fc0a5c176.jpg"},"summary":"在世界的每一个角落里，存在着这样一种生物：它们下等且奇怪，完全不同于任何动植物，自古以来为人类所敬畏，不知何时开始，被称为“虫”。它们有自己的生命形态以及生存方式，而这些方式或许会影响到人类的世界。“虫师”这个职业便应运而生，他们对虫进行研究记录，并接受人们的委托，解决由虫引起的奇异事件。故事主人公银古（中野裕斗 配音）就是这样一名四处云游的虫师，他一头银发，仅用一只眼睛视物；常常叼着一根烟，背着一个大行囊，翻山越岭，追寻虫的足迹。《虫师》自第一季开播后深受观众喜爱，沉寂数年后TV动画系列再度启动，制作人员由原班人马组成。此次的《虫师·续章》将会动画化原作的全部剧情。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"剧情,动画,悬疑,奇幻"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-10-23 08:50:14","classic":true,"classicRank":24,"franchise":"虫师","playable":true,"episodeCount":20,"playGroups":[{"name":"modum3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第1集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/N0MH5RRW/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第2集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/GhUDqpdb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第3集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/OUK1lcSU/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第4集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/dwXNRG3D/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第5集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/pWdJp0XA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第6集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/x1gOlTez/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第7集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/4VCepg3A/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第8集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/5wcFDvY9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第9集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/6v5gONYF/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/6o9up858/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/piMNU9qw/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/3MfH3mRz/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/TQH6CM43/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://play.modujx10.com/20231022/QHMLl9lD/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://play.modujx10.co